  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing Partnership for SMEs Technology Transition with Banco Comafi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction involves a USD-denominated senior loan to Banco Comafi S.A. (&#x201C;Comafi&#x201D; or the &#x201C;Bank&#x201D;) of up to US$20 million with a three-year tenor, to be renewed once at IDB Invest&#x2019;s discretion. The Project is aimed at supporting the client to enhance its portfolio through security interest financing and finance leases for the technological overhaul of Small and Medium-sized Enterprises (SMEs).</narrative>
  </description>
